* Avoid declaring unnecessary variables inside functions, especially if they're only used once.

Here's a slightly optimized version of your code:
```cpp
void cycleLEDs(int interval) {
  constexpr int nOutPins = sizeof(outPins) / sizeof(outPins[0]);
  static unsigned long lastChange = 0;
  static int currIndex = 0;

  const bool forward = interval > 0;
  const int nextIndex = (currIndex + (forward ? 1 : -1) + nOutPins) % nOutPins;

